## 🤖 Re-deriving from intent

This change conflicts with what landed, and the merge engine could not combine them. An agent is now re-deriving it from the intent in the description, on your CI runner (re-implementing the change on the new head, tier 4b).

The result lands only if it passes the acceptance tests, stays inside this change's files, and is close to the reviewed diff.

<details>
<summary><b>Footprint</b> · writes 2 targets · affects 3 · 1 test group</summary>

**Writes** `shop::cart` `shop::pricing`

**Affects** `shop::cart` `shop::checkout` `shop::pricing`

**Tests** `shop`

Two changes conflict only when one writes what the other writes or affects.
</details>

